# OpenFamilyCompass Contributors

## Original Authors

OpenFamilyCompass was created to help families manage tasks, behavior, and rewards in a transparent, community-driven way.

## How to Contribute

We welcome contributions from the community! If you'd like to contribute to this project:

1. Check out our [SECURITY.md](SECURITY.md) for security guidelines
2. Submit a Pull Request with a clear description of your changes
3. Ensure your code follows the project's style guidelines
4. Add yourself to this file when your contribution is merged

## Contributors

Add your name here when your first contribution is merged:

- [Your Name/GitHub Handle] - [Brief description of contribution]

