## Acknowledgments

- Built with [Spring Boot](https://spring.io/projects/spring-boot)
- Frontend with [Thymeleaf](https://www.thymeleaf.org/) and [Bootstrap](https://getbootstrap.com/)
- Mobile app with [Android/Kotlin](https://kotlinlang.org/)
- Database: [PostgreSQL](https://www.postgresql.org/)
- Containerization: [Docker](https://www.docker.com/)

